[al:新概念英语第三册]
[ti:The Death of a Ghost]
[00:00.52]Lesson 30 | 第30课
[00:01.74]The death of a ghost | 幽灵之死
[00:08.93]Why did the two brothers keep the secret? | 为什么两兄弟保守了这个秘密？
[00:13.24]For years, villagers believed that Endley farm was haunted. | 多年来，村民们一直认为恩德利农场闹鬼。
[00:18.47]The farm was owned by two brothers, Joe and Bob Cox. | 这个农场归乔和鲍勃·科克斯两兄弟所有。
[00:23.38]They employed a few farmhands, but no one was willing to work there long. | 他们雇了一些农场工人，但没有人愿意在那里长时间工作。
[00:28.83]Every time a worker gave up his job, he told the same story. | 每次有工人辞职，他们都会讲同样的故事。
[00:34.34]Farm labourers said that they always woke up to find that work had been done overnight. | 农场工人说，他们醒来时总是发现工作已经在一夜之间完成了。
[00:41.24]Hay had been cut and cowsheds had been cleaned. | 干草被割了，牛棚也被清理了。
[00:45.61]A farm worker, who stayed up all night, claimed to have seen a figure cutting corn in the moonlight. | 一位彻夜未眠的农场工人声称在月光下看到一个身影在割玉米。
[00:53.22]In time, it became an accepted fact that the Cox brothers employed a conscientious ghost that did most of their work for them. | 渐渐地，科克斯兄弟雇佣了一个尽职尽责的幽灵为他们做了大部分工作，这成了一个公认的事实。
[01:03.13]No one suspected that there might be someone else on the farm who had never been seen. | 没有人怀疑农场上可能还有其他人从未被见过。
[01:09.72]This was indeed the case. | 事实确实如此。
[01:12.39]A short time ago, villagers were astonished to learn that the ghost of Endley had died. | 不久前，村民们惊讶地得知恩德利的幽灵已经死了。
[01:19.57]Everyone went to the funeral, for the 'ghost' was none other than Eric Cox, | 所有人都去参加了葬礼，因为那个“幽灵”不是别人，正是埃里克·科克斯，
[01:26.42]a third brother who was supposed to have died as a young man. | 据说他年轻时就去世了的第三个兄弟。
[01:31.00]After the funeral, Joe and Bob revealed a secret which they had kept for over fifty years. | 葬礼结束后，乔和鲍勃揭露了一个他们保守了五十多年的秘密。
[01:38.96]Eric had been the eldest son of the family, very much older than his two brothers. | 埃里克是家里的长子，比他的两个兄弟大得多。
[01:45.14]He had been obliged to join the army during the Second World War. | 第二次世界大战期间，他被迫参军。
[01:49.88]As he hated army life, he decided to desert his regiment. | 由于他厌恶军队生活，他决定开小差。
[01:55.48]When he learnt that he would be sent abroad, | 当他得知自己将被派往国外时，
[01:58.76]he returned to the farm and his father hid him until the end of the war. | 他回到了农场，他的父亲把他藏起来直到战争结束。
[02:03.96]Fearing the authorities, Eric remained in hiding after the war as well. | 由于害怕当局，埃里克在战后也一直躲藏着。
[02:09.95]His father told everybody that Eric had been killed in action. | 他的父亲告诉所有人埃里克在战斗中牺牲了。
[02:14.42]The only other people who knew the secret were Joe and Bob. | 唯一知道这个秘密的其他人是乔和鲍勃。
[02:19.10]They did not even tell their wives. | 他们甚至没有告诉他们的妻子。
[02:22.36]When their father died they thought it their duty to keep Eric in hiding. | 当他们的父亲去世后，他们认为有责任继续把埃里克藏起来。
[02:27.38]All these years, Eric had lived as a recluse. | 这么多年来，埃里克一直过着隐居生活。
[02:32.24]He used to sleep during the day and work at night, | 他白天睡觉，晚上工作，
[02:35.48]quite unaware of the fact that he had become the ghost of Endley. | 完全没有意识到自己已经成为了恩德利的幽灵。
[02:40.25]When he died, however, his brothers found it impossible to keep the secret any longer. | 然而，当他去世后，他的兄弟们发现再也无法保守这个秘密了。